==Esperanto==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|eo|felicha}} {{qualifier|H-system spelling}}
* {{l|eo|felicxa}} {{qualifier|X-system spelling}}

===Etymology===
From Italian {{m|it|felice}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/feˈlit͡ʃa/|lang=eo}}

===Adjective===
{{eo-head}}
# {{lb|eo|of a|person}} full of well-being, [[happy]]
#: ''Mi estas la plej '''feliĉa''' kiam vi estas '''feliĉa'''.''
#:: I am the happiest when you are happy.
# {{lb|eo|of a|thing}} providing [[happiness]]
#: '''''feliĉan''' naskiĝtagon''
#:: '''happy''' birthday
# {{lb|eo|of a|person}} coming out well, [[fortunate]]
#: '''''feliĉa''' je monludo''
#:: '''lucky''' in gambling
# {{lb|eo|of a|thing}} working out well, [[felicitous]], [[favorable]], [[successful]]
#: ''alkonduki aferon al '''feliĉa''' fino''
#:: to conduct an affair to a '''happy''' end (a successful conclusion)

